    "faq_mnMDVa": {
      "type": "faq",
      "blocks": {
        "item_eCGL3r": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Are treadmills safe for seniors?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, they are designed with safety in mind and include a <strong>safety lock system</strong> that allows the treadmill to stop immediately when needed, helping ensure safer use for seniors. 🛡️</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_3AyCqb": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Do these treadmills have handrails?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, some models come with <strong>front handrails</strong>, while others are designed with <strong>side support rails</strong>. Both options provide <strong>extra stability and support</strong> during walking, helping users feel more secure while exercising.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_eFyD67": {
          "type": "item",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "title": "🎁 Order Early for a Stress-Free Holiday (Christmas Tips)",
            "content": "<p>Buying early means your gift won’t arrive late — and even if the recipient prefers something else, you’ll still have time to switch to a perfect Plan B.<br/>Ordering now also helps you avoid holiday shipping delays and ensures your treadmill arrives well before Christmas.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_zqDrUq": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Are they easy to use for seniors?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, they are designed to be <strong>simple and easy to operate</strong>, with basic controls for <strong>start/stop and speed adjustment</strong>.</p><p>Most models use <strong>clear buttons or remote control</strong>, so seniors can begin walking without complicated setup or learning steps.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_rQ798D": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I walk at a slow speed?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, depending on the model, the minimum speed starts at either <strong>0.6 mph or 1.0 mph</strong>, both of which are suitable for slow, gentle walking and daily light exercise.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_7Mijxq": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Are they safe for knees and joints?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, they are designed with <strong>shock-absorbing running belts</strong> that help reduce impact on knees and joints during walking. This makes daily exercise more comfortable and joint-friendly, especially for low-intensity workouts.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_XXL3KA": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How long is the warranty for WELLFIT products?",
            "content": "<p>All WELLFIT treadmills and walking pads come with a <strong>1–3 year warranty</strong>, depending on the specific model. We stand behind the quality of our products and are here to support you long after your purchase.</p><p>For full details, please visit our official <a href=\"https://wellfittreadmill.com/pages/warranty-policy\"><strong>Warranty Policy</strong></a>.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_hCb8ib": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Do I need to pay extra for shipping or taxes?",
            "content": "<p><strong>No, you don't.</strong> All WELLFIT products come with <strong>free shipping and no additional taxes, </strong>consumers <strong>do not need to pay the 7%-15% sales tax</strong>. The price you see on our website is the final price — no hidden fees at checkout.<br/><br/></p>"
          }
        },
        "item_LcPLgr": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How soon will I receive my order after purchase?",
            "content": "<p>We ship from <strong>7 U.S. warehouses</strong> located in <strong>California, Georgia, Texas, New Jersey, Houston, and New York. </strong>Most orders are delivered within <strong>1–5 business days</strong>, depending on your location.<br/></p>"
          }
        }
      },
